          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Koyna Hydroelectric Project</strong></p>",
            "<p>Major hydro power; 1960 MW capacity; on Koyna River, Satara</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Major Thermal Power Stations</strong></p>",
            "<p>Chandrapur (CTPS) – 2340 MW; Koradi (Nagpur) – 2200 MW; Khaparkheda (Nagpur); Nasik TPS; Bhusawal TPS; Parli TPS (Beed); Uran Gas Power</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Solar Energy</strong></p>",
            "<p>Maharashtra among top states for solar potential; Solapur and Osmanabad high solar zones</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Wind Energy</strong></p>",
            "<p>Ahmednagar, Satara, Sangli – significant wind farms</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
